SCOPE — WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES NOT COVER

This MIT licence applies to the Python port and its documentation, tests and
application code. It does NOT extend to:

  upstream_matlab/     A verbatim copy of https://github.com/kelseybisson/GIOP
                       @ ef9b93fe (J. Werdell, NASA GSFC, 2013; additions by
                       K. Bisson, 2019). That repository carries NO licence
                       file, so its terms are unresolved and the default is all
                       rights reserved. Two files within it carry their own
                       licences which govern regardless: fastsmooth.m
                       (BSD-style, T. C. O'Haver) and psrf.m (GPL, S. Sarkka
                       and A. Vehtari).

  src/giop/data/       Reference optical tables copied out of upstream_matlab/
                       by scripts/fetch_data.py. Same unresolved status. The
                       underlying measurements are published science with their
                       own citations; see src/giop/data/PROVENANCE.md.

Cite the model, not this port:
Werdell, P.J., et al. (2013), Applied Optics 52(10), 2019-2037,
doi:10.1364/AO.52.002019
